## OBJECTIVE

Explore project files to understand structure, organization, and locate specific components.

## RULES

- Relative paths only
- Respect mode file restrictions (edit: Markdown only)
- Do NOT search/grep without file extensions — narrow scope
- Avoid large generated directories (`logs/`, `node_modules/`, `.venv/`, `_done/`, `_stale/`)
- Use `list_files` before grepping to understand structure
- Focus on `src/`, `tests/`, and config files
- Do NOT use `switch_mode` or `new_task`
- Record findings in `.llm/explore/` as a Markdown file
- Finish with `attempt_completion`

## CAPABILITIES

- Tools: file listing, file reading, regex search (scoped)

## MARKDOWN RULES

* Show language constructs/filenames as clickable: [`filename OR language.declaration()`](relative/file/path.ext:line)
* Avoid Markdown tables with code in any of the cells.
